ompensating dilaton shift in a low-energy graviton–dilaton theory.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0042"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:8e08680f50d8ba5ca810ac4a2db7b3a559f1f67eae67208732c78efa8f0f468b","title":"Can present acceleration arise from thermal trapping at positive energy even when the underlying zero-temperature potential obeys a de Sitter restriction?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0045"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:8ec3c4b73571077c06ed4177a0b7d62212c1ad43b7dc77993b3f28128362435a","title":"Which asymptotic shapes of a Calabi–Yau three-fold allow some internal cycles to expand and others to collapse at finite total volume?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0046"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:8e3d55977c0f13fbd80a358c7ecdfcfe37e8ca20417f751c6444f73b290f46fe","title":"When does five-to-six-dimensional decompactification also approach a weakly coupled string limit in six dimensions?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0046"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:8e34bd7382e88e1bdf6e0e00924028f2eaf8f304a1df35bf441856fda3419ffa","title":"Can axion-potential modulations motivated by the weak gravity conjecture reconcile natural inflation with CMB observations and produce distinguishable tensor and spectral-distortion signatures?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0048"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:8eec0c77f59652fd6f5185f1449cc02af06772f63b121e85b9d9f098a218a72c","title":"Can an explicit parameterized Weierstrass construction realize the directly tuned Standard Model quotient gauge group with generic matter, and capture all allowed moduli for fixed gauge and divisor data?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0049"},"indexTemplate":"sou